flowchart LR
  Web[不可信网页] -->|Origin / DOM| Extension[浏览器扩展]
  Extension -->|Native Messaging<br/>一次性句柄| Client[本地安全客户端]

  subgraph Local[本地高信任边界]
    direction TB
    Client --> Store[(本地安全数据库<br/>内容寻址对象库)]
  end

  Client -->|密文对象| Storage[不可信同步存储层]
  Client -->|随机名称 / 证明请求| State[可验证状态控制层<br/>透明日志]
  State --> Anchor[周期公告层]
  State -->|Descriptor + ProofBundle| Client

  class Web person
  class Extension,Client service
  class Store datastore
  class Storage,State,Anchor control

  classDef person fill:#08427B,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#073B6F,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef service fill:#1168BD,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#3C7FC0,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef datastore fill:#FFF3E0,color:#1A1A2E,stroke:#F5A623,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef control fill:#F3E5F5,color:#1A1A2E,stroke:#7E57C2,stroke-width:1.5px
